OL,3,GNEWSA'Murdered teen's legacy inspired  
OL,4,Amy legal career'                       
OL,6,FA woman who has been supported to train
OL,7,Fas a barrister by a bursary which      
OL,8,Fhonours a murdered teenager has said   
OL,9,Fshe wants to become a "hard-working"   
OL,10,Fprosecutor who "treats witnesses with  
OL,11,Fcare".                                 
OL,13,FSharon Uche, 24, from Manchester, said 
OL,14,Fbeing chosen for the Anthony Walker    
OL,15,FBursary Scheme, which supports aspiring
OL,16,Flawyers from under-represented         
OL,17,Fbackgrounds, had given her the         
OL,18,Fconfidence to "reach my goals" and     
OL,19,F"opened doors".                        
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
